msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And even if they ⟪k:1⟫do⟪k:2⟫ connect the tracks,⟪k:3⟫will it really be in any shape for "
"people to ride?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫연결된다 쳐도 ⟪k:1⟫승객을 태울 상태가 되긴 할지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D0B22842_3B9F_4B98_9B2F_DA112D578F3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
