#: scenario3:scenario3_DA535972_E041_4735_8200_774F92D43089
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71088bc7faa59545fd4a6c5d8f8d9efa49793127a67db999d623223e9a11d4f3
