msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA535972_E041_4735_8200_774F92D43089"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo went silent, but I am certain this is what was going through his head:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫야코포는 침묵했지만, ⟪k:1⟫내심 이렇게 생각했을 거랍니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9284FAB1_ED7F_4207_9568_67323E6E71E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8e7ce96083d16e7a5af6fad1515fa2045c30ae2237206ba92982962b221027d
#. default-sha256: 9ab1595719e44c4571619e86029bf05b7743413af1c11a92f5d2dcce932099ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9284FAB1_ED7F_4207_9568_67323E6E71E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(You’re a bunch of damned imbeciles if you can’t see that the entire country’s put their "
"weight behind this endeavor. ⟪k:1⟫This is why you have so much trouble making even a few "
"thousand.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(이게 얼마나 큰 국가적 대사업인지도 모르는 머저리들.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ 흥, ⟪k:3⟫그런 대가리니까 종이"
"쪼가리 몇만 장 만드는 것도 실패하지)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0618b5513ad2c192a998a33d6d093d5e2c9a3020734d00dfb532c03ed6a0bccd
#. default-sha256: 1b077ced6e15598cf611ea9d4cae3d2891d846f4ea30677ac94e3b7ae4643346
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫At the time, a great railway was being built across the breadth of "
"the continent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫이 당시에는 ⟪k:6⟫거대한 대륙을 넘나들기 위한 ⟪k:7⟫선로가 지어지고 있"
"었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a87a11cc779bf5e223f7d313ec8da492b84da0352e968853d78dd2c59370de12
#. default-sha256: b187b8c11e164966e893beefbce024b24e27bdc386344fa75397889dc1bc15ed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Construction was spearheaded by two large rail companies, in competition for both prestige "
"and a bigger share of this massive national enterprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫착공한 것은 ⟪k:1⟫두 철도회사.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫국가적 대사업에 회사의 위신을 걸고 경쟁했지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1e697647ba5489cc20e22f9daf6069362a220d8d58fc5b4a15b6aaf981eaa11
#. default-sha256: 77fda7010d567640551cb7473338e4f64f81ae69db335f20d6dc73ab192076e2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Union Pacific Railroad Company started building from the east, and the Central Pacific "
"Railroad Company from the west."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫동쪽에선 유니온 퍼시픽 철도회사, ⟪k:1⟫서쪽에선 센트럴 퍼시픽 철도회사가 ⟪k:2⟫착공을 맡았습니"
"다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7e257468303abfedd6d65f1e193c0320c0e28a47ef724949e5b0d38d65a36de
#. default-sha256: 6e7d2254e885643ba9741544c1701eadde772bbdcc59bfcc3b548042565cbf7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But government bonds alone were not enough to finance the massive undertaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 대사업에는 국가의 보조금 뿐만 아니라 ⟪k:1⟫더한 자금이 필요해지기도 했지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdcfc53fa9fd29c8f8918d3698f354de34191198e5c270d6ce9bc8e47a80bf63
#. default-sha256: 2d20905d0c4d8c1bb5a590dd2044666dc00aeb6f8ee72062f49fd673bf52e052
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By the way, there’ve been some less-than-pleasant reports about workers dyin’ on the job for "
"the company you chose—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Central Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫네가 투자한 데…… ⟪k:2⟫센트럴 말이야, ⟪k:3⟫노동자 사망사건이 문제로 제기됐다며?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f1dc2b9750ec7658c65c2976af5eb79fbc3083d8ab17e993864cde6553eb712
#. default-sha256: e6da924e6f5ed04c34c820806f6fe8e851c6222f3ff902b68daf7e066b4d2b84
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ya mean how they’re usin’ explosives to blast through the mountains? ⟪k:1⟫Makin’ quite "
"a bang, they are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아, ⟪k:1⟫산을 폭탄으로 무너트렸댔나? ⟪k:2⟫참 요란하게도 하지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13f46dead27f7ee80a55988dadcd9507502019516fba495a3b93408282719040
#. default-sha256: 6ed2db9bd5d932883953aea41e4a788302b15d8a11942634a2dee5da7231c52a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if this gets to be much bigger of a fix,⟪k:1⟫they’re not gonna be able to continue "
"construction.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You shoulda at least put your money in the more sure bet of the two—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫the Union Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫큰 난리가 나면 ⟪k:1⟫공사할 여유도 없어질걸?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫차라리 견실한 유니온 쪽에 투자하지 그랬"
"어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d6d7a39a75f6e93e85c9e7a86e98dccf6b9f291f0def3e68e39533e178eafa
#. default-sha256: ef7f53602a106233dcbb9b200e363f26385d4e77157805a3a2d313faaee14114
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’ll cost ya to hire replacement workers, and if they keep kickin’ the bucket, you’re gonna "
"have trouble findin’ more—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노동자를 새로 고용하는 데도 ⟪k:1⟫돈이 들잖아. ⟪k:2⟫사망사건이 더 문제시되면 ⟪k:3⟫일손이 없어"
"질 수도――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f938400d47f36d9e04062e9942b336c1d99d363565f266432df76c488f35f0de
#. default-sha256: 82657f35b648e1c6ec2a7e8c4e82a26822c42fff8b2129480412f544a478594b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My goodness.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And here I thought you all had spines."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……나 원. ⟪k:5⟫너희가 그렇게 소극적인 놈들일 줄은 몰랐어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be528ab69f249f6722ca0ed98394d3fb3234ebd005be9571277df1a8f213718d
#. default-sha256: 5d2efe8d50d3a3f93b2b9304bd1ebd39927c7aa7d03e8c9c86e59b080f93a9da
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You think we’re gonna run out of workers just because a few ate it? ⟪k:3⟫Hah. "
"There’re so many we don’t even know what to do with them all. ⟪k:4⟫There’s not a chance that well "
"will dry up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫노동자가 죽는다고? ⟪k:3⟫일손이 없어져? ⟪k:4⟫흥, ⟪k:5⟫썩어 넘치도록 있는 놈들이잖"
"아. ⟪k:6⟫고갈될 턱이 ⟪k:7⟫있나."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a37d60f79ff011ff440589ec67b9d83c2018c086f4c4bd8872fb04b88ce9178d
#. default-sha256: 5fe8b72f896964e65009a3c8c209f456ab824ce590fae7af19ee3cc79a16d8ca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And if, by some chance, it ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫, all we have to do is scoop up a shipful of "
"blacks or yellows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫고갈된다 쳐도, ⟪k:2⟫피부 누런 놈이든, 까만 놈이든 간에 ⟪k:3⟫다른 나라에서 들이면 그만이"
"지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9e035dd1fa08ba55fe0a4e0c7d41c818fb9c735d671f4e543a6078ec9da8ab6
#. default-sha256: 9e2e2852b183a4a0834b0a78f2698491d27b703f82c9ef361a66740bc5dbf875
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You won’t get anywhere if you spend your time worrying about a few measly laborers. ⟪k:1⟫"
"This is an endeavor backed by the entire nation.⟪k:2⟫Their deaths are honorable, in service of "
"their country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노동자 따위나 걱정해 봤자 ⟪k:1⟫되는 거 하나 없어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫국가적 대사업에 순직시켜 주잖아. "
"⟪k:4⟫오히려 명예로운 죽음 아니겠어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd2aba4daf273ae41b12cdb6964ff0c8483ab57f2ddfe6e40c9c71401e26ee70
#. default-sha256: ea9a7e87ee2a3c3cd3f89f8c5523d33f15dc1212c2cc09b2d0f0d7718b7aceb8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The biggest loss is not of people’s lives, but of ⟪k:2⟫time⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The longer a "
"project takes, the more money it costs,⟪k:6⟫and the less profit we make."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫무엇보다 ⟪k:2⟫가장 큰 손실은 사람 죽는 게 아니야. ⟪k:3⟫지연이지.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫사업이 지연될"
"수록 ⟪k:6⟫돈이 더 들고, ⟪k:7⟫순환도 안 좋아져."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21cad81718ddf01c4d89a6827fd95228afe9befd96f1f005361de3ed7cb79bde
#. default-sha256: 6baa78b813c59263410ee886efb5145b3a1e31ae633795a2c6fe7b92d72c9820
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What we seek is rapid progress,⟪k:2⟫even if the methods to obtain it are messy—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫or deadly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫험한 수단을 쓰든, 사람이 죽어 나가든, ⟪k:2⟫빠르게 사업을 진행하는 게 우리가 추구해야 하"
"는 바야."

